#CATEGORY Pro nejmensi
#CATEGORY Dema
#CATEGORY Libor Lasota
#CATEGORY Programovani
#CATEGORY Programy
#CATEGORY BASIC
# Games offered by the list menu (Up or [E] in the menu), one per line: NAME;MODEL;NOTE[;REMAP[;PAD[;KEYS[;INPUT]]]]
# KEYS is a free text with the controls, shown under the list for the selected game (no diacritics).
# INPUT lists the devices besides the keyboard the game can be played with, shown as icons left of the name: P gamepad
# (the buttons of the pad are enough), R TV remote control over HDMI-CEC (only cursor keys, OK, digits). Empty = keyboard only or unknown.
# Rule for R: the game needs at most 5 buttons (the keys of PAD without Escape and without the keys that REMAP maps onto)
# and all of them are on the remote (cursor keys, OK = Enter, digits). Do not use ';' in the text of a column.
# NAME is the tape file in the share directory, MODEL is the PMD 85 model (1 or 2), NOTE is shown
# in the list (the commands to type), REMAP maps host keys to the PMD 85 keys a game reads (SDL key names,
# e.g. Left=Left Shift,Right=V: AUTO and ZED steer with [Shift] and [V]). PAD lists the buttons of the web remote
# control for the game, Label:key,... (SDL key names, key&key presses two at once), the default set is used without it. Generated from simpmd/data/tapes and the table in simpmd/README.
ADC;2;ROM basic2.rmm, FONT, TYPE LOAD 1, TYPE RUN;Left=F10,Right=F12,E=F8,Z=F11,Up=F8,Down=F11,Space=F1,Left Shift=F2;Left:F10,Right:F12,Up:F8,Down:F11,K0:F1,K1:F2,Esc:Escape;chodicka: F10 vlevo, F12 vpravo, F8 nahoru, F11 dolu, F1 akce (pad: D-pad, A = F1, LB = F2, B = Enter);P;BASIC
AIRRAID;1;MGLD 00, JUMP 1000;;;Air Raid (Nitra 1987): R hra, S strelba, sipky vlevo/vpravo;
AUTO;1;MGLD 00, JUMP 2000;Left=Left Shift,Right=V;Left:Left,Right:Right,Shift:Left Shift,Esc:Escape;Shift = vlevo, V = vpravo;PR
BARBAR;2;ROM basic2.rmm, FONT, TYPE LOAD 1, TYPE RUN;Left=F10,Right=F12,E=F8,Z=F11,Up=F8,Down=F11,Space=F1,Left Shift=F2;Left:F10,Right:F12,Up:F8,Down:F11,K0:F1,K1:F2,Esc:Escape;chodicka: F10 vlevo, F12 vpravo, F8 nahoru, F11 dolu, F1 mec, F2 pouzij (pad: D-pad, A = F1, LB = F2, B = Enter);P;BASIC
BASIC-G;2;ROM basic2.rmm, FONT, TAPESAVE;;;BASIC-G V2.0: vlastni programy z klavesnice (LIST, RUN, ...), SAVE n a LOAD n pres soubor saves/BASIC-G;;Programovani
